{"ID":"20240205165634-hibfpke","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165634-hibfpke","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165634-hibfpke\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083752-nvb147j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607094812-1lzeyso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165802-1b9vwpj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"023甘草","type":"doc","updated":"20240801142047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206083752-nvb147j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083752-nvb147j","updated":"20240206083801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于内蒙古、山西、甘肃、新疆、宁夏等地。\n【性状】\t圆柱形，外皮松紧不一。表面红棕色或灰棕色，具显著的纵皱纹、沟纹、皮孔及稀疏的细根痕。质坚实，断面略显纤维性，黄白色，粉性。根茎表面有芽痕，断面中部有髓。气微，味甜而特殊。饮片为斜切片。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t益气补中，清热解毒，祛痰止咳，缓急止痛，调和药性。\n【炙品】\t炙甘草：类圆形或椭圆形切片，表面红棕色或灰棕色，微有光泽，切面黄色至深黄色，质稍黏，具焦香气，味甜。性味甘、平。补脾和胃，益气复脉。\n【注解】\t“菊花心”： 指药材断面维管束与较窄的射线相间排列，呈放射状纹理，形似开放的菊花。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083750-nan1uzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083750-nan1uzn","updated":"20240206083750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083750-vexmms0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240618102912-domo9ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618102912-domo9ud","updated":"20240618102912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618102912-j4vp5dw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165802-1b9vwpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165802-1b9vwpj","updated":"20240801131935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 472px;","style":"width: 462px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618104609-419t7cw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 462px;\" parent-style=\"width: 472px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 293px;","style":"width: 283px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甘草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甘草 1-20240801131935-g70qbi0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 283px;\" parent-style=\"width: 293px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801134634-31r77s4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801134634-31r77s4","updated":"20240801134634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 500px;","style":"width: 490px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甘草 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甘草 15-20240801134634-1cw8oo4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 490px;\" parent-style=\"width: 500px;\"}"},{"Type":"No